WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:01.500
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:06.139
<v><b>A:</b></v> How long <b>was</b> Sidney Poitier married to his first wife?

00:00:06.623 --> 00:00:09.185
<v><b>B:</b></v> He <b>was</b> married to her for 15 years.

00:00:10.101 --> 00:00:13.548
<v><b>A:</b></v> What role <b>did</b> he <b>play</b> in <i>To Sir, with Love</i>?

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:15.462
<v><b>B:</b></v> He <b>played</b> a teacher.

00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:18.075
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:21.680
<v><b>A:</b></v> How long <b>has</b> Denzel Washington <b>been</b> married?

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:25.161
<v><b>B:</b></v> He<b>’s been</b> married since 1983.

00:00:26.022 --> 00:00:28.075
<v><b>A:</b></v> What kind of roles <b>has</b> he <b>played</b>?

00:00:28.566 --> 00:00:31.513
<v><b>B:</b></v> He<b>’s played</b> many roles in Shakespeare plays.